---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Free Coding Games for Kids — Robot Coding Adventures | Kids Code"><div class="wrap"><div class="page-head"><span class="eyebrow">Code adventures · No typing needed</span><h1>Little robot.<br/>Big adventure.</h1><p>Meet Bit. Excellent at following instructions. Terrible at guessing! Build a plan to guide your robot to the star.</p></div><div class="activity-shell"><section class="panel"><label for="mission">Choose a mission</label><select id="mission"></select><div id="robot-grid" class="robot-grid" role="img" aria-label="Robot mission board"></div><p id="mission-concept" class="note"></p><div id="robot-feedback" class="feedback" role="status">Choose commands, then run your plan.</div></section><section class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">You’re in charge</span><h2>Your plan for Bit</h2><p class="tiny">Tap an arrow to add a command. Tap a command in your plan to remove it. Arrows always point up, right, down, or left on the board.</p><label for="repeat">Repeat each new command</label><select id="repeat"><option value="1">1 time</option><option value="2">2 times</option><option value="3">3 times</option><option value="4">4 times</option><option value="5">5 times</option></select><div class="control-row" id="command-buttons"><button class="button small white" data-dir="up">↑ Up</button><button class="button small white" data-dir="right">→ Right</button><button class="button small white" data-dir="down">↓ Down</button><button class="button small white" data-dir="left">← Left</button></div><div id="command-list" class="command-list" aria-label="Your commands"></div><p class="tiny" id="command-count">0 steps planned · maximum 80</p><div class="actions"><button id="robot-run" class="button dark">▶ Run my plan</button><button id="robot-clear" class="button ghost">Clear / stop</button></div><button class="button small ghost" id="robot-hint">Give me a little hint</button><p class="hint" id="robot-hint-text" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="robot-next" class="button" hidden>Next mission →</button><noscript><p>Turn on JavaScript to play the robot missions.</p></noscript></section></div><section class="section grid3"><div class="card"><h3>1. Plan it</h3><p>Look at the star and the green obstacles. Which little steps will get Bit there?</p></div><div class="card"><h3>2. Test it</h3><p>Run your commands. Watch how the robot follows exactly what you told it to do.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>3. Tweak it</h3><p>Hit an obstacle? That’s useful information! Change a command and try again.</p></div></section></div><script>import '../../scripts/robot';</script></Layout>
